Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:15.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.93,0:00:18.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So many potential Dads!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:21.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Move, move!\N- Stay calm and keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.19,0:00:22.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki! Haru! All clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:26.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't relax just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're heading out first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:33.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Aki, you can look for your dad later!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:34.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oka...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:38.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:41.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's our status?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:44.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Most of the evacuation is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:48.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Teams are heading this way and\Nchecking for anyone left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:50.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Good.\N- Move it, Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My group's on their way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're all going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.01,0:00:58.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, no one's been hurt\Nby the zombies, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.48,0:01:02.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're just about finished clearing\Nthe fountain area!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:04.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good. Get inside. We're closing the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:05.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.98,0:01:07.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We're closing the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You guys better get inside, too. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.37,0:01:17.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Takamo, I can't find Hina!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:21.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.34,0:01:30.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:34.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hina!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.69,0:01:44.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:48.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Close the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:46.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thank you, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:50.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:53.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Allow me to thank you, as well.\NMuch appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:54.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:57.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,But I would've managed without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:03:58.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Easy with the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Liar. You barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I guess we're even, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo, we need a strategy meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:16.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:18.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to all of you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.93,0:04:20.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:28.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,At this point, we know the zombies are\Npouring out of Old Park Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:31.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There was a horde of zombies\Non the underground tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:35.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It seems they've turned the place\Ninto their nest right under our noses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:38.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Me, me! I was the one who noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on, this isn't the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.53,0:04:49.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Um... If her reckless behavior is what\Nallowed the kairis... zombies inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:50.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:52.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yu actually apologized for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:53.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:57.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later,\Nthis would've happened anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:05:01.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,If anything, we were able to evacuate more\Nquickly because I was there with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:02.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I thought you had wiped out\Nall the zombies underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.76,0:05:08.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes. We cleared them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.22,0:05:13.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,About that—the entrance to the underground\Ntunnels is located away from the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:18.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We thought we'd sealed it tight\Nto keep the zombies out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:21.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's the scout.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:23.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.87,0:05:25.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Just as you predicted, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:28.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The barricade at the tunnel entrance\Nhas been breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:31.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,More zombies are still pouring in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:34.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's it like inside the tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.92,0:05:38.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There's an eerie howling wind and\Nthe groans of countless zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:42.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looks like the noise is drawing\Nthe zombies in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They are naturally averse to water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:48.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They may have settled in there\Nto stay out of the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:52.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, too,\N'cause I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:06:00.61,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Either way, hordes of zombies are still\Npouring out of the station exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sealing it off won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:05.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Then cutting them off at the source
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:09.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,should prevent any more\Nzombies from pouring in.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.78,0:06:09.37,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}FOOD: 4-7 DAYS / AMMO: 3 DAYS /\NEQUIPMENT: 30 PERSONNEL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:13.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We'll reclaim the base section by section,\Nthen seal off the station
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.21,0:06:16.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,to finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:18.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How many troops will we need?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We'll need a lot of explosives, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll lead the main force myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:26.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,After the demolition is complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:28.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,we'll use that momentum to wipe out\Nthe remaining zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.43,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh! I wanna go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:31.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can't agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We don't know how many zombies\Nare near the tunnel entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:41.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And deploying our main force\Ncould leave the gate vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:43.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's why I called you all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.78,0:06:44.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:47.12,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:51.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Seems you really can\Npick up the scent of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.54,0:06:53.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,In that case, I want you\Nto protect the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:59.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What? But I wanna go out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:04.80,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There are countless people\Nwho depend on this Ueno Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:10.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I need your help keeping them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm asking because I know you've\Ngot what it takes to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.81,0:07:15.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Okay, I'll do it!\N- What a pushover...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:19.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Whatever comes our way, leave it\Nto the great leader Aki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.\NIf Aki's okay with it, then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:24.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You can count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.49,0:07:25.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.32,0:07:32.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's settled, then.\NWe'll move out tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Until then, we'll reinforce\Nthe gate's defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:35.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:37.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.83,0:07:39.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:40.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:43.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:48.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're strictly forbidden\Nfrom leaving the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:50.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Stay here and defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:06.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I forgot to eat dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.15,0:08:08.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we left our fish behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We had some deer jerky, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Aki.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:16.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Do you really want to stay here?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:21.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This side isn't heavily guarded yet.\NWe could make a break for it in Tricy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.04,0:08:24.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Do we really have a reason\Nto risk our lives by staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:26.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on, Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:29.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The people here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:33.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're all so nice.\NThey've been really kind to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:36.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They fed us, even though\Nwe're complete strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:39.10,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't really know\Nhow to explain it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I wanna see them smiling again\Nwhen this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:45.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So I'm sorry, guys! But please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:47.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A little too late to ask, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see this place\Nwiped out, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:53.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Says the one who was practicing her bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Some things need to be said!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:58.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're the leader, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.41,0:09:00.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Now, let's eat up and\Nget ready for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.09,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Oh, the jerky!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:05.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:07.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:11.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm joining the fight tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:13.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.35,0:09:18.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.06,0:09:21.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Fighting is forbidden for you, Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:22.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:36.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on, just waiting around is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's go join the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:41.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Our job right now\Nis to defend the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:45.38,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's right. You can go crazy after\NMiss Prickly and her crew return,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Your aim is terrible. Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:54.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:57.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm making the rounds while my\Nsister and the others are away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:03.14,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Keeping busy helps me stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:06.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Right? Everyone else gets to do stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:08.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm strong enough to fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:09.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I barely remember it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:13.65,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,but I mowed down a whole bunch\Nof zombies with a flamethrower!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well, that does sound rather dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:20.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,No, it's not! I wanna join the fight.\NYou feel the same way, right, Saigo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:23.25,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Actually, I wouldn't go that far—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:24.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:27.04,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It seems the operation has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:30.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Looks like they've reached\Nthe tunnel entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:31.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're going all-out over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.92,0:10:35.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm so jealous! I wanna go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:42.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That sound just now...\NIt seemed pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.02,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:48.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Where is that noise coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is where we have our...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:53.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A storage shed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:59.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it's not being used anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:05.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Kairis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.29,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,B-But how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.89,0:11:25.98,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:28.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I knew it! I smelled them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:30.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:31.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.11,0:11:33.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How did the kairis get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.03,0:11:34.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Natsuki-san, please use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.53,0:11:38.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,All right, let's retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.41,0:11:41.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they just keep coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.24,0:11:42.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:45.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that shed supposed\Nto be for storage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It certainly was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:49.71,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's it! The tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That whole area sits right\Nabove the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:56.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The back of the shed must\Nbe connected to the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:57.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:01.01,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Takamo's attack on the tunnel entrance\Nsent the kairis into a frenzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:04.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,and now they're pouring out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.22,0:12:08.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Forget the explanation!\NDo something about the zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.19,0:12:09.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I-I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.15,0:12:14.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:16.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Has everyone evacuated?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's all taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:19.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Any response from the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.66,0:12:23.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not yet. They're pretty far away,\Nso maybe she didn't see our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:28.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There are too many of them.\NThey're gonna climb over the enclosure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's fight them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?! You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Can't be helped. I'll back you guys up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll go get the word to Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:41.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.39,0:12:46.27,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can take the maintenance passage to the\Nexit where there aren't as many zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.27,0:12:48.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're going to run all the way there?\NThat's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:51.44,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I have to get out before the zoo\Nis swarming with zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:54.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Me, me! I'm coming with you!\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:58.15,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Once we get to Tricy, I'll do the driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.15,0:13:01.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I did teach you to drive,\Nbut in that case, I should also—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:02.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You've got the stamina of a wet noodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:03.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}WET NOODLE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:05.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Not to mention you're terrible at archery.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.58,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TERRIBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.79,0:13:09.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You'd probably pass out before we even\Nmade it outside and end up getting bitten.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.58,0:13:10.46,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PASS OUT
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:11.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You'll just slow us down.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.46,0:13:11.46,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}SLOW US DOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.75,0:13:12.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Saigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:14.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.63,0:13:16.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm borrowing the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:18.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:26.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}NO TRASH!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.94,Layer1_Font1,,0,0,0,,{\an8}ENTRANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll open the gate!\NYou start the engine, Sakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:30.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.19,0:13:38.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They noticed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:39.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.53,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san, the zombies are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:43.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Don't distract me!\N- Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:47.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Mirrors, check! Doors locked, check!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.49,0:13:50.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Engine, check! All clear ahead!\N- Sakura-san, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:55.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.54,0:13:57.84,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Ugh, move already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.94,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We ran over another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.19,0:14:14.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Another what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:23.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My sister's probably going to be mad at me\Nfor leaving without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:25.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- But that doesn't make sense.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:30.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,She's just like Yu. They should\Nlet us have a little more freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:32.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Freedom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.79,0:14:36.88,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's it. Let's run away!\NCome with us, Saigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:43.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I think my sister stopped letting me go\Noutside because she couldn't bear
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:47.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,to see me turn into a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:52.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,One day, some of our people were\Nbitten by zombies and got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.27,0:14:56.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My sister confined them\Nto the zoo enclosures.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.61,0:15:03.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Most of them became ordinary zombies,\Nbut a few turned into a type that doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:05.99,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,attack people—the socially awkward type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:09.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,My sister has been gathering\Nother socially awkward zombies,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:13.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,hoping that someday they'll turn back\Ninto the people they once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.21,0:15:18.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly walk away from my sister\Nknowing how she feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:20.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Of course, even if I got infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:25.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,there's no guarantee I'd become\Nthe socially awkward type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:30.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I think you're naturally suited to being\Nthe socially awkward type.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.26,0:15:31.35,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:36.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Because you can't even tell\Nyour sister how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:40.36,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,...tain Takamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.03,0:15:52.49,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Captain Takamo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:55.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:59.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How many times have I told you not\Nto leave the base? What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.88,0:16:08.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You have to come back to the base!\NHurry, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:20.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's taking Sakura so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:23.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I just hope she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:24.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Have faith in Sakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:27.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Aki, go help them over there.\N- Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:28.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We'll help out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:30.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yu, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yu fell off the cliff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:50.47,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.35,0:17:01.85,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:04.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.31,0:17:06.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Yu, are you okay?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:07.90,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:14.95,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.66,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The cavalry is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:19.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:21.37,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.37,0:17:23.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm changing her name from\NMiss Prickly to Miss Close Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:28.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Time to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.67,0:17:30.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll join the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:32.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:33.97,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:39.73,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Burn to ashes, you rotten kairis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:42.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Burn it clean! Don't wimp out on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:45.48,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's all follow Sakura's lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.86,0:17:47.86,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo, let's go grab {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.40,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:00.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The storage shed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:02.58,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Is that all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:05.13,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,They're still coming out.\NDon't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:06.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:08.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,{\an8}PSHH
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.72,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Empty already? Useless shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:18.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:22.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Water works better than fire for zombies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:25.19,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's that? It looks so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.19,0:18:26.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A fire truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:33.24,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Captain Takamo.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.49,0:18:37.45,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The Old Park Station exit has been\Nsuccessfully sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.45,0:18:39.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,This is the last area.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.45,0:18:43.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Let's finish them off.\NGet the hoses ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.33,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We've hooked it up to the water tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:47.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.96,0:18:50.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Never mind, just hold that hose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:51.00,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Here we go, Sakura-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:54.34,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:57.55,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Maximum pressure. Start spraying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:18:59.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Water the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.89,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And don't forget the zombies, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.45,0:19:18.16,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,The base is now fully operational again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:19.28,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:24.54,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Also, Sis... Aki-san and\Nher group are heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:26.83,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I told you not to call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Captain Takamo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a view!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:34.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You okay there, Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:35.76,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm fine-not-fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Wait, which is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:41.18,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:42.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Sakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.14,0:19:48.69,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,How crazy! We took back a base this\Nhuge from the zombies in just one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.69,0:19:50.81,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Hmph. I appreciate your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.61,0:19:54.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We took out zombies little by little,\Nday after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:55.82,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,We even lost some of\Nour own along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.82,0:19:57.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It took us two years to get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:03.62,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I ask everyone we let into this base—\NWould you like to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:05.50,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Nope.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:09.92,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,And your little brother says\Nhe's coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:11.75,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.30,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:17.59,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,N-No! He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.01,0:20:21.05,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo's my precious treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:23.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,S-S-S-Sis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.60,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So why... Why would he...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.77,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:33.11,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'm not a little kid anymore.\NI can handle going outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.61,0:20:38.20,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I've decided to think for myself and\Nmake my own choices from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:41.78,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:45.79,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here at Ueno Base\Nand keep supporting you, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:48.08,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Saigo... You...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.21,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I was just playing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:54.67,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Y-You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.17,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You're much cuter when\Nyou show your softer side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:01.26,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.26,0:21:03.93,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you moron! Ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:07.22,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,So adorable! Miss Close Call\Njust became Miss Mushy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.39,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Consider this a parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.56,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.57,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,A bazooka? How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:20.03,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,It's a whole different world beyond here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:24.70,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I chose not to venture any further,\Nand here I am today. Take caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.91,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- We've got our own bazooka.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:28.87,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.87,0:21:32.96,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,I see. So you weren't just out\Nhere for a picnic after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.96,0:21:36.46,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That said, we'll put it to use\Nif things get desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.42,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Good.\N- Lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.30,0:21:40.51,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.51,0:21:42.63,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Can I have the bazooka you made?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.39,0:21:45.64,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,That's for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:49.06,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Why not? Stupid, stupid Yu! Stupid Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.19,0:21:55.31,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,See ya! We'll stop by again\Non our way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.31,0:21:58.32,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please be careful out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:01.07,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:05.41,Font1_OutlineShadow,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye!\N- See you soon!

